        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a firm, we operate across four regions—North America, EMEA, APAC, and Latin America—balancing global reach with local expertise.",
        "start_character": 11963,
        "end_character": 12094
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Central to our approach is We Are Korn Ferry, an enterprise-wide go-to-market model designed to bring the full breadth of Korn Ferry’s capabilities, insights and expertise to clients.",
        "start_character": 7421,
        "end_character": 7604
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we regularly look to expand our specialized expertise through internal development and strategic hiring in targeted growth areas.",
        "start_character": 21975,
        "end_character": 22117
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In fiscal 2026, we accelerated firm-wide AI transformation initiatives designed to embed AI into key workflows and digital platforms across our solutions and enterprise functions, improving consultant effectiveness, efficiency, quality, and client outcomes while maintaining strong standards for security, transparency and responsible use.",
        "start_character": 11623,
        "end_character": 11962
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To deliver value at scale across this broad client base, we operate through three primary engagement models:",
        "start_character": 9945,
        "end_character": 10053
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We invest in internal mobility, leadership development and recognition programs that support long-term careers.",
        "start_character": 12725,
        "end_character": 12836
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "This increase reflects the growing traction of We Are Korn Ferry, expanding client demand for connected solutions, and demonstrates the value of bringing together the full breadth of Korn Ferry's expertise to help clients achieve better business outcomes.",
        "start_character": 8653,
        "end_character": 8908
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "To bring our strategy to life, we deliver services through five solution areas.",
        "start_character": 13733,
        "end_character": 13812
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We believe this structure better reflects how work is delivered across the firm, aligns more closely with how clients buy our services and supports our We Are Korn Ferry operating model.",
        "start_character": 14873,
        "end_character": 15059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As we continue to evolve and execute our strategy, we are confident that our investments in innovation and client-tailored solutions align with and support our growth plan, while delivering value to shareholders.",
        "start_character": 15767,
        "end_character": 15979
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
        "accession_number": "0000056679-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Because our consultants work collaboratively across industries, functions and areas of expertise, we are able to apply a wider range of experiences and perspectives to client challenges.",
        "start_character": 8082,
        "end_character": 8268
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000056679-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000056679-26-000021-76075f05cd8f8b0a",
